a.org/wiki/Adur_Gushnasp]; Heraclius sacked the temple in 623/4 [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adur_Gushnasp]; The fire survived the sack and continued to burn into the Islamic era [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adur_Gushnasp]"}]'::jsonb),
